  "description": "§bPolybenzimidazole§r (PBI), a cutting-edge synthetic polymer, serves as the essential plastic for §bIV-tier and higher circuits§r. Its exceptional properties enable the construction of highly compact and reliable §dAdvanced SMD Components§r.

